{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026OkRd1UCFEm1795581907.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>朝鮮外務省宣布，驅逐瑞士駐當地外交辦事處代表，要求48小時內離境。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.NK.SWISS-1300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026lyRULWK0ki1795581776.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>朝中社報道，瑞士制裁朝鮮松濤園國際少年團夏令營，屬於敵對行為。朝鮮外務省召見瑞士駐朝鮮外交辦事處代表阿斯捷，送交要求關閉辦事處，以及阿斯捷離境的照會。報道指，朝鮮絕不歡迎任何侵害朝鮮主權權利與公民利益的行為。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.NK.SWISS-1300_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026TMQX8z5IUP1795581771.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>瑞士當局本月初，把該夏令營列入對俄羅斯的制裁名單，指控朝鮮利用夏令營，對被俄方強行帶走的烏克蘭兒童實施強制同化、思想灌輸、軍事化教育。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T05:23:54.462628+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":206,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T04:19:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T10:17:14.436436+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T05:17:16.508522+00:00","content_hash":"b4c7639c24ee1072af6c05e14a5826df259b82d39bd87c4437ff0e67307fbf05","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T05:23:54.462628+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}